                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun game but will require about 10 minutes of getting it to work if the game doesn't work try\r\n\r\nCopy and paste \"steam.dll\" from your Steam or Steam Library Folder and put it directly into \"SteamLibrary\\SteamAppps\\common\\Jade Empire\". \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOpen notepad.\r\n\r\nDon't write anything into it.\r\n\r\nSave it as \"SystemInformation.xml\"\r\n\r\n    It must be saved as a blank notepad. Do not put anything in it.\r\n\r\n    Click \"Save As Type\", it must read \"All Files\".\r\n\r\n    Save this file in \"SteamLibrary\\SteamAppps\\common\\Jade Empire\\data\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you want to use controller go to properties select steam controller support active\r\n\r\nopen file in jade empire folder and open file called Jade Empire its a configuration type file\r\n\r\nlocated where the controller settings in it and apply the following\r\nMovement L/R=Left StickX\r\nMovement U/D=Left StickY\r\nLook L/R=Right StickX\r\nLook U/D=Right StickY\r\nMenu=Button 8\r\nCombat Pause=Button 7\r\nFight Style 1=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 2=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 3=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 4=Hat 1\r\nAttack=Button 1\r\nBlock=Button 2\r\nStrong Attack=Button 3\r\nFocus=Button 4\r\nChi Strike=Button 6\r\nChi Heal=Button 5\r\nTarget Left=Left StickZ\r\nTarget Right=Right StickZ\r\nNo Target=-\r\nFree Look=Button 10Movement L/R=Left StickX\r\nMovement U/D=Left StickY\r\nLook L/R=Right StickX\r\nLook U/D=Right StickY\r\nMenu=Button 8\r\nCombat Pause=Button 7\r\nFight Style 1=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 2=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 3=Hat 1\r\nFight Style 4=Hat 1\r\nAttack=Button 1\r\nBlock=Button 2\r\nStrong Attack=Button 3\r\nFocus=Button 4\r\nChi Strike=Button 6\r\nChi Heal=Button 5\r\nTarget Left=Left StickZ\r\nTarget Right=Right StickZ\r\nNo Target=-\r\nFree Look=Button 10\r\n\r\nIf theres FPS issues try restarting your computer worked for me.",
